      "body": "\n        <h2>Exhibition stand design and construction in Tangier: one single provider, no subcontracting</h2>\n        <p>At <strong>Standarte</strong> we design and build your <strong>stand in Tangier</strong>, in the city's exhibition venues and fair spaces, from start to finish: design, manufacturing in our <strong>own workshop</strong>, transport —including by ship across the Strait—, assembly and dismantling. A <strong>single point of contact</strong> for the entire project, with no subcontracting or intermediaries, backed by more than <strong>20 years of experience</strong> and a presence at Tangier's major events —<a href=\"/en/ferias/maroc-in-mode-mim-tanger\">Maroc in Mode (MIM)</a>, <a href=\"/en/ferias/tanger-nexus\">Tanger Nexus</a>, <a href=\"/en/ferias/tanger-fashion-week\">Tanger Fashion Week</a>, the <a href=\"/en/ferias/amith-nord-tanger\">AMITH Nord meetings</a> and the <a href=\"/en/ferias/eventos-industriales-tanger-med\">industrial events of Tanger Med</a>—. By controlling every phase in-house, deadlines are firmer and the finish you approve is exactly the one that gets built.</p>\n\n        <h2>How we handle your stand in Tangier, step by step</h2>\n        <ol>\n          <li><strong>Briefing and objectives.</strong> We get to know your brand, your product and what you want to achieve at the fair in order to size the space and the investment.</li>\n          <li><strong>Design and 3D prototype in 3 days.</strong> We design the stand with high-fidelity 3D engineering software and deliver a photorealistic prototype so you can validate every detail before anything is manufactured.</li>\n          <li><strong>Validation with the <a href=\"/en/audited-project\">Audited Project</a> System.</strong> Every approval —design, budget and changes— is recorded in a verifiable, archivable file: our 100&nbsp;% guarantee that what gets built is what was approved.</li>\n          <li><strong>Manufacturing in our own workshop.</strong> We produce the custom carpentry, furniture and graphics with artisanal quality control, ready to ship.</li>\n          <li><strong>Transport and assembly.</strong> We coordinate the maritime logistics across the Strait and our fitters set up the stand with the prefabrication completed 24&nbsp;h before opening.</li>\n          <li><strong>Dismantling.</strong> We remove the stand at the close of the event so you don't have to worry about a thing.</li>\n        </ol>\n\n        <h2>Tangier: fashion, textiles, industry and logistics</h2>\n        <p>Tangier concentrates a powerful trade-fair profile in <a href=\"/en/actividad/moda-textil\">fashion and textiles</a> —with northern Morocco's garment industry—, in <a href=\"/en/actividad/logistica\">logistics</a> tied to Tanger Med, one of the largest ports in the Mediterranean, and in <a href=\"/en/actividad/multisectorial\">multisector</a> business gatherings. We build <strong>fashion and luxury stands</strong> with runway and showcase, functional <strong>industrial stands</strong> and custom <strong>business spaces</strong>.</p>\n        <p>How much does a stand in Tangier cost? With our <strong>instant calculation based on square metres</strong> you get a price estimate in seconds. Check the tiers and calculate your investment at <a href=\"/en/prices\">stand prices</a>.</p>\n\n        <h2>Technical documentation and logistics across the Strait</h2>\n        <p>Tangier's exhibition venues and the Tanger Med area host fashion shows, textile and industrial gatherings and business forums, well connected to the port of Tanger Med and to the Iberian Peninsula by sea. We master the technical documentation the venues require —electrical and water connections, projects for work at height and fire-reaction certificates— and we resolve the <strong>maritime logistics</strong> with complete workshop prefabrication, leaving the stand assembled and verified 24&nbsp;h before opening.</p>\n\n        <h2>Fairs and sectors in Tangier</h2>\n        <p>We build across Tangier's fair calendar —each name links to its fair because we genuinely cover it—: <a href=\"/en/ferias/maroc-in-mode-mim-tanger\">Maroc in Mode (MIM)</a> (<a href=\"/en/actividad/moda-textil\">fashion and textiles</a>), <a href=\"/en/ferias/tanger-nexus\">Tanger Nexus</a> (<a href=\"/en/actividad/multisectorial\">multisector</a>), <a href=\"/en/ferias/tanger-fashion-week\">Tanger Fashion Week</a> (<a href=\"/en/actividad/joyeria\">fashion and luxury</a>), the <a href=\"/en/ferias/amith-nord-tanger\">AMITH Nord meetings</a> (<a href=\"/en/actividad/moda-textil\">textile industry</a>) and the <a href=\"/en/ferias/eventos-industriales-tanger-med\">industrial events of Tanger Med</a> (<a href=\"/en/actividad/logistica\">logistics and industry</a>). That they all appear linked is the proof of real coverage that no competitor can demonstrate.</p>\n\n        <h2>The largest coverage in Spain and Portugal</h2>\n        <p>Standarte offers the <strong>largest peninsular coverage</strong> with a <strong>single builder</strong> and the <strong>same quality standards</strong>. On the other side of the Strait we build in <a href=\"/en/stand_design_assembly_cadiz\">Cádiz</a>, <a href=\"/en/stand_design_assembly_malaga\">Málaga</a> and <a href=\"/en/stand_design_assembly_seville\">Seville</a>, as well as across all of Spain and Portugal. This Iberian network is an asset that no local provider can match.</p>\n\n        <h2>Pat, your free trade-fair advisor</h2>\n        <p>Even before designing the stand, <strong>Pat</strong> —our interactive advisor— recommends the key fairs and congresses for your sector in Spain and Portugal and prepares your request in a minute. A free, exclusive advisory service to get it right with the events where you should exhibit. <a href=\"#pat\">Talk to Pat</a> at the top of this page.</p>\n\n        <h2>100&nbsp;% guarantee: the Audited Project System</h2>\n        <p>Every project is recorded in a verifiable, archivable file —3D prototype, budget and approvals— that acts as a witness to the agreement and guarantees that exactly what you approve gets built, with no surprises. It is our own trust tool: discover the <a href=\"/en/audited-project\">Audited Project System</a>.</p>\n\n        <h2>Assembly logistics in Tangier</h2>\n        <p>We solve the challenge of exhibiting in Tangier with maritime transport coordinated across the Strait, complete workshop prefabrication and a clean, punctual set-up, with access via the port of Tanger Med. Calculate your investment instantly at <a href=\"/en/prices\">stand prices</a>.</p>\n\n        <h2>Why choose Standarte for your stand in Tangier</h2>\n        <p>More than 20 years of experience, our own workshop, over <a href=\"/en/#prototipos-3d\">136 3D projects</a> in our portfolio and an average rating of 4.9/5. We bring together what the competition doesn't offer as a package: <strong>3D prototype in 3 days</strong>, <strong>instant price calculation per m²</strong>, <strong>Audited Project guarantee</strong>, Pat's advice and the <strong>largest coverage in Spain and Portugal</strong>, including on the other side of the Strait. With Standarte your brand conveys solidity, technical quality and maximum commercial commitment in Tangier.</p>\n        <p><strong>Request your quote in 24&nbsp;h</strong> or calculate your stand instantly at <a href=\"/en/prices\">prices</a>. We design, manufacture and assemble your stand in Tangier with a single call.</p>",
