          "a": "At Navarre's events: NAVARTUR and the Reyno de Navarra International Tourism Fair (tourism), EDIFICA (sustainable construction), the Student Show and Navarra Jobs (education and employment), the Navarre Organic Fair and Navarra Wine & Gastronomy, among others."
